name    rogue
prog    rogue
# The first level: a step, the drop question cancelled with ESC, then quit.
rate    0.5
size    24 80
wait    6
snap    start
key     l
wait    2
key     d
wait    3
snap    drop-asked
key     \e
wait    3
snap    cancelled
key     Q
wait    3
key     y
wait    5
key     \s
wait    4
snap    topten
key     \s
wait    4
expect  Level:
expect  drop what?
expect  Top  Ten  Rogueists
